// UNSUPERVISED LEARNING
// Input:  unlabelled features only
// Goal:   find structure / compress / generate
// Examples:
//   - Clustering:      k-means groups customers
//   - Dimensionality:  PCA, t-SNE reduce feature space
//   - Generation:      VAEs, GANs produce new samples

// REINFORCEMENT LEARNING
// Input:  environment, reward signal
// Goal:   learn policy π(state) → action to maximise cumulative reward
// Examples:
//   - Game playing:    AlphaGo, Atari DQN
//   - Robotics:        motor control policies
//   - RLHF:           fine-tuning LLMs with human preference

